  "description": "In this puzzle game you control a plane and draw figures with a smoke trail.\n\r\n\n\r\nTo progress you have to be precise, but to excel you also need to be fast and smart.\n\r\nThere are 60 levels, can you get three stars on all of them?\n\r\n\n\r\nPop the balloons for bonus credits and to increase your score.\n\r\n\n\r\nIn free form creative mode your imagination is the only limit.\n\r\nDraw whatever you want!\n\r\nUse various smoke trails to make even more crazy drawings!\n\r\n\n\r\nUnlock new planes and paintjobs to customize them!",
